# Email OTP / staff access
# With Supabase configured, sign-in codes are sent by Supabase Auth (set up SMTP + the email template
# in the Supabase dashboard; see README -> "Setting up live mode"). With it unset, the app runs in demo
# mode and shows codes on screen. Never ship demo mode to production.
